  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_6c37bd64-0872-4933-8701-9be71baa604a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"834\" height=\"469\"></span></strong></p><h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">废弃瞭望塔</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">是由</span> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MasterOWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">MasterOWS</span></a><span style=\"color:#fff\">制作的一款瞭望塔模组</span></strong></h1><hr><h2>支持 <strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Forge</span> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">1.20.1</span></strong> 和 <strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">1.19.2</span></strong>，以及 <strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">NeoForge</span> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">1.21.1</span></strong> 和 <strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">1.21.4</span></strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fabandoned-watchtowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_59025fc5-22ce-4614-a6ad-1a92522454e7.png\" alt=\"Modrinth图标\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></span></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-watchtowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_dc1e4831-2a8f-48a1-962c-65b66ad50890.png\" alt=\"CurseForge链接\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></span></strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MasterOWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_4685c306-a947-4da3-8f06-4455c31ebb04.png\" alt=\"YouTube图标链接\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></span></strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>废弃瞭望塔是一款生成在森林生物群系中的瞭望塔模组，具体生成在森林、繁花森林、针叶林、白桦林和草原中。非常适合恐怖或冒险类整合包，以及作为游戏第一晚的落脚点。</p><h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>📝功能特性：</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li>随机生成的房间布局</li>\n<li>随机生成的多种楼梯</li>\n<li>随机生成的战利品</li>\n<li>两种不同版本，其中一种更为稀有</li>\n<li>夜间可见的灯光，方便远距离辨认</li>\n<li>不同高度的塔楼</li>\n<li>阳台上的椅子</li>\n</ul><h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>🙋问答环节：</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">问：</span> 瞭望塔内有多张床吗？</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">答：</span> </strong>房间生成中最多可容纳4张床，方便你和朋友们使用！<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">问：</span> 与其他模组兼容吗？</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">答：</span> </strong>是的！你可以将任何其他模组与废弃瞭望塔一起使用！<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">问：</span> 如何更改生成率/生成半径？</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">答：</span> </strong>使用 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-watchtowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka API for abandoned watchtowers</a></strong> 即可实现，你可以在 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-watchtowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></strong> 找到它。</li>\n</ul><h2><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">⚖️ 使用指南：</span><br></strong></h2><p><strong>欢迎在任何整合包或视频中使用废弃瞭望塔，注明出处非必需但强烈推荐。</strong></p><p><strong>仅 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">CurseForge</span> 和 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Modrinth</span> 为官方发布站点，其他网站的文件可能包含恶意软件或病毒。</strong></p><p><strong>未经授权，请勿将我的作品上传到其他平台。</strong></p><h2><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">🔌版本信息：</span></strong></h2><p><strong>如果你想要更多模组化体验，可以查看<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-watchtowers-refurnished\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">废弃瞭望塔：</span>&nbsp;</a><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-watchtowers-refurnished\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">焕然一新</a>！</span></span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_622624f1-355a-4b08-811c-550eafe961d2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">如果你喜欢我的Minecraft模组，可以查看我的</span> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">YouTube</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">内容，点击 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MasterOWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a></span> 即可！</span></strong></p>",
